1
00:00:00,527 --> 00:00:02,157
(Bernadette:)What kind of revenge is that?

2
00:00:02,162 --> 00:00:04,932
(Bernadette:)This woman screwed with my job.
She's got to pay.

3
00:00:05,766 --> 00:00:07,866
(Penny:)Okay, all right, honey,
you know what?

4
00:00:07,868 --> 00:00:10,968
(Penny:)There was something I was too
scared to tell you yesterday,

5
00:00:10,971 --> 00:00:14,741
a-and now... I'm just balls-out
terrified to tell you, but...

6
00:00:14,741 --> 00:00:16,411
(Penny:)the truth is it...

7
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,780
(Penny:)wasn't Barbara Chen, it was me.

8
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:20,749
(Penny:)I'm the reason everyone knows.

9
00:00:20,747 --> 00:00:22,477
(Bernadette:)Why did you do that?

10
00:00:22,482 --> 00:00:25,382
(Penny:)Well, it was an accident.
I am so sorry I lied.

11
00:00:26,253 --> 00:00:27,683
(Bernadette:)Get out.

12
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:36,690
(Penny:)Oh, you know, I also lied
about the girl in the bathroom.

13
00:00:36,696 --> 00:00:38,826
(Penny:)Yeah, we actually dumped
her retainer in the toilet

14
00:00:38,832 --> 00:00:41,532
(Penny:)and put it back in her mouth.

15
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:49,039
(Sheldon:)I don't understand why
I can't talk at this meeting.

16
00:00:49,042 --> 00:00:51,812
'Cause when you talk,
it enrages people.

17
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:54,549
(Sheldon:)Okay.

18
00:00:54,548 --> 00:00:55,948
(Sheldon:)Quick question.

19
00:00:55,949 --> 00:00:58,079
(Sheldon:)Am I allowed
to exchange pleasantries

